 "description": "Waits up to 45 seconds for active picture generation or the finished video. projectId identifies the video; optional operationId identifies its original picture/video approval. A pending response is a nonterminal timeout containing the exact nextCall for another bounded wait. A completed video response contains video.url. Free and read-only; no generation, approval, quote, payment or credit change.",
